<https://w3id.org/dpv#Agent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Agent"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An Agent is a dpv:Entity that is (a) acting on behalf of another Entity; and (b) is authorised to do so by that Entity"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Entity> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Entity> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "the Entity the Agent is acting on behalf of can be a human or non-human and a legal or non-legal entity. For specific distinction, see dpv:LegalAgent and tech:MachineAgent. The form and validity of authorisation through which the Agent is empowered to represent and act on behalf of the Entity is not defined or covered in this concept"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-10-28"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:person-harshvardhan-j-pandit ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#entities-classes> .

