  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Age Verification can include verification of the exact age, e.g. being 21 years old, a date, e.g. birth date is 01 January 1969, or a condition, e.g. age is over 21 years and the person is an adult. Specific dedicated resources should be used to further express information and processes associated with Age Verification, for example the Age Verification Vocabulary https://w3id.org/age/"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-02-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
