<https://w3id.org/dpv> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology>, <http://www.w3.org/ns/dx/prof/Profile> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/dpv/2.3> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> <https://www.w3.org/groups/cg/dpvcg/> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/title> "Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV)"@en ;
