  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Label> "DPV"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "The Data Privacy Vocabulary (DPV) provides terms (classes and properties) to represent information about processing of personal data, for example - purposes, processing operations, personal data, technical and organisational measures."@en ;
