  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Procedure where the background of an entity is assessed to identity vulnerabilities and threats due to their current or intended role"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#SecurityProcedure> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> _:b300dfe3a50c9ba2c545e7e4b2a2a3933 ;
