<https://w3id.org/dpv#B2B2CContract> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#LegalBasis> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Business-to-Business-to-Consumer Contract"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A contract between two businesses who partner together to provide services to a consumer"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#B2BContract>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#B2CContract> ;
