  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#contract-types-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractPartiallyFulfilled> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractFulfilmentStatus> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Partially Fulfilled"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Status representing contract where some of its terms have been fulfilled, and others are yet to be fulfilled in a manner that does not constitute a violation or breach of the contract i.e. there is still time and opportunity to complete the terms"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractFulfilmentStatus> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-01-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
