  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Statistical Confidentiality Agreement"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "An agreement outlining conditions, criteria, obligations, responsibilities, and specifics for classification and management of 'confidential data' based on a statistical framework"@en ;
