<https://w3id.org/dpv#OftenFrequency> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Frequency> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Often Frequency"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Frequency where occurrences are often or frequent, but not continuous"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Frequency> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-06-15"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
