<https://w3id.org/dpv#ContextuallyAnonymisedData> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contextually Anonymised Data"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Data that can be considered as being fully anonymised within the context but in actuality is not fully anonymised and is still personal data as it can be de-anonymised outside that context"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#PseudonymisedData> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#PseudonymisedData> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "To distinguish between partially anonymised data that can be effectively treated as anonymised data (e.g. in processing) within a context (e.g. an organisation), the concept ContextuallyAnonymisedData should be used instead of AnonymisedData. Transfer of this data outside of the context should consider that it is not fully anonymised and that it is still personal data"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-06-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:person-harshvardhan-j-pandit ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#personal-data-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#MonotonicCounterPseudonymisation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#TechnicalMeasure> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Monotonic Counter Pseudonymisation"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A simple pseudonymisation method where identifiers are substituted by a number chosen by a monotonic counter"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Pseudonymisation> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> _:ba6697e518d9b31b99c8bca854ed85bbd ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-08-17"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2022-10-13"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:person-harshvardhan-j-pandit ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#technical-measures-classes> .

