<https://w3id.org/dpv#DataControllerDataSource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#DataSource> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Controller as Data Source"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Data Sourced from Data Controller(s), e.g. a Controller inferring data or generating data"@en ;
