<https://w3id.org/dpv#Entity> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Entity"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A human or non-human 'thing' that constitutes as an entity"@en ;
