<https://w3id.org/dpv#ThirdParty> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Third Party"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A ‘third party’ means any natural or legal person other than - the entities directly involved or operating under those directly involved in a process"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#LegalEntity> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#LegalEntity> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Third Party in the context of personal data processing are entities other than the data subject, controllers, processors, and authorities"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> _:b66b1c0d1c9af6cfe365db44e86195ccc ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2019-06-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
