  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#entities-legalrole-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#CompatibilityUnknown> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#ReuseCompatibility> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Compatibility Unknown"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Status indicating the compatibility of the context with an earlier context is currently unknown"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ReuseCompatibility> ;
