<https://w3id.org/dpv#SellDataToThirdParties> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Purpose> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sell Data to Third Parties"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Purposes associated with selling or sharing data or information to third parties"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#SellProducts> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Sell here means exchange, submit, or provide in return for direct or indirect compensation. Was subclass of commercial interest, changed to reflect selling something"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2019-04-05"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
