<https://w3id.org/dpv#isIndicatedAtTime> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property>, <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
