<https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractFulfilled> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractFulfilmentStatus> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Fulfilled"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Status representing contract where all its terms have been fulfilled in a manner that does not constitute a violation or breach of the contract"@en ;
