  <http://purl.org/dc/dcam/rangeIncludes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Entity> ;
  <https://schema.org/rangeIncludes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Entity> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "The use of 'entity' is inclusive of entities (e.g. Data Processor) as well as 'agent' (e.g. DPO). For indicating technological implementation, the property isImplementedByTechnology should be used."@en, "Also used to indicate the Entity that implements or performs a Right Exercise Activity"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2019-05-07"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2022-01-26"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
