<https://w3id.org/dpv#InnovativeUseOfTechnology> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Innovative use of Technology"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Indicates that technology is being used in an innovative manner"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ProcessingContext> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ProcessingContext> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Innovative here refers to 'state of the art' rather than the implementing entity, and can be for either new technology or new uses of existing technology"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2023-12-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
