<https://w3id.org/dpv#AssistiveAutomation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#AutomationLevel> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Assistive Automation"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Level of automation corresponding to Level 1 in ISO/IEC 22989:2022 where automation is limited to parts of the system or a specific part of the system in a manner that does not change the control of the human in using/driving the system"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#AutomationLevel> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Human Involvement is implied here, specifically the ability to make decisions regarding operations, but also possibly for intervention, oversight, and verification"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> _:bae43fdb35e5b17467c6072924c18cebb ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2023-12-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2024-04-20"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:person-harshvardhan-j-pandit, _:person-delaram-golpayegani ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#processing-context-classes> .

