  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Security Assessment"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Assessment of security intended to identify gaps, vulnerabilities, risks, and effectiveness of controls"@en ;
