<https://w3id.org/dpv#PhysicalInterceptionProtection> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#PhysicalMeasure> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Physical Interception Protection"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Physical protection against interception e.g. by posting a guard"@en ;
