  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#purposes-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#HumanInvolvementForControl> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#HumanInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Human Involvement for control"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Human involvement for the purposes of exercising control over the specified operations in context"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#HumanInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Control is a broad term that can be applied to various stages and operations. It maps to None, Assistive, and Partial automation models."@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-09-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/modified> "2023-12-10"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
