  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#processing-context-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#ProcessingContext> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Processing Context"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Context or conditions within which processing takes place"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Context> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Context> ;
