<https://w3id.org/dpv#UntilTimeDuration> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Until Time Duration"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Duration that has a fixed end date e.g. 2022-12-31"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Duration> ;
