<https://w3id.org/dpv#Consult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Processing> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Consult"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "to consult or query data"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Use> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related> <https://specialprivacy.ercim.eu/vocabs/processing#Query> ;
