  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#rules-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#Adult> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#HumanSubject> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Adult"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A natural person that is not a child i.e. has attained some legally specified age of adulthood"@en ;
