<https://w3id.org/dpv#FeeRequirement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Fee Requirement"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Concept indicating whether a fee is required"@en ;
