<https://w3id.org/dpv#CannotReverseProcessEffects> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#EntityNonPermissiveInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Cannot Reverse Process Effects"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Involvement where entity cannot reverse effects of specified context"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#EntityNonPermissiveInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Effects refer to consequences and impacts arising from the process or from the outputs of a process"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
