<https://w3id.org/dpv#ExpressedConsent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#LegalBasis> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Expressed Consent"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Consent that is expressed through an action intended to convey a consenting decision"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#InformedConsent> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Expressed consent requires the individual take a specific and unambiguous action that directly indicates their consent. This action may be a part of other processes such as setting preferences, or agreeing to a contract, or other matters not relating to consent. An example of expressed consent is interacting with a checkbox within a dashboard or clicking a button on a web form"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-06-21"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> _:person-georg-p-krog, _:person-harshvardhan-j-pandit, _:person-paul-ryan, _:person-julian-flake ;
  <http://purl.org/vocab/vann/example> <https://w3id.org/dpv/examples#E0018> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy> <https://w3id.org/dpv#> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#consent-types-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#hasImpactOn> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property>, <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has impact on"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Indicates the thing (e.g. plan, process, or entity) affected by an impact"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/dcam/domainIncludes> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Impact> ;
