<https://w3id.org/dpv#DataSecurityManagement> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#OrganisationalMeasure> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Data Security Management"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Measures associated with management of data security"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#DataGovernance>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#SecurityProcedure> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Examples of data security management are assessing the appropriate security controls such as encryption, testing the implemented security controls, and ensuring it is protected and safeguarded from unintended actions"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
