<https://w3id.org/dpv#ActiveRight> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Right> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Active Right"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The right(s) applicable, provided, or expected that need to be (actively) exercised"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Right> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Active rights require the entity to expressly exercise them. For example, a Data Subject exercising their right to withdraw their consent."@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-10-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
