  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#legal-basis-properties> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#ConsentUnknown> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#ConsentStatus> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Consent Unknown"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "State where information about consent is not available or is unknown"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ConsentStatusInvalidForProcessing> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Consent states can be unknown, for example, when information is not available, or cannot be trusted, or is known to be inaccurate"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> _:b81862437284348cec0143b34a90c27af ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2022-06-22"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
