<https://w3id.org/dpv#Advertising> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Purpose> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Advertising"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Purposes associated with conducting advertising i.e. process or artefact used to call attention to a product, service, etc. through announcements, notices, or other forms of communication"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Marketing> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Advertising is a subset of Marketing. Advertising by itself does not indicate 'personalisation' i.e. personalised ads."@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2020-11-04"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
