  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#status-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#hasProcess> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property>, <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "has process"@en ;
