<https://w3id.org/dpv#Erase> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#Processing> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Erase"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "to remove data from existence i.e. without the possibility of retrieval"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#Remove> ;
