  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Pseudonymised Data"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Pseudonymised Data is data that has gone a partial or incomplete anonymisation process by replacing the identifiable information with artificial identifiers or 'pseudonyms', and is still considered as personal data"@en ;
