  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "ROPA under GDPR Art.30 has specific requirements regarding the information to be maintained. Additionally, Data Protection Authorities also provide additional information guidelines for information to be maintained in a ROPA. For more information see https://w3id.org/dpcat"@en ;
