<https://w3id.org/dpv#ReversingProcessOutput> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#EntityPermissiveInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Reversing Process Output"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Involvement where entity can reverse output of specified context"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#EntityPermissiveInvolvement> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "Reversing of outputs indicate discarding the output and going back to the previous output. This is different from correction of output which allows modification of the output - implying continuation of the process."@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-05-11"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
