  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Request Rejected"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "State of a request being rejected towards non-fulfilment"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#RequestStatus> ;
