<https://w3id.org/dpv#LargeScaleOfDataSubjects> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#DataSubjectScale> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Large Scale Of Data Subjects"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Scale of data subjects considered large within the context"@en ;
