  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "This concept was modified as a breaking change in v2.3 with the introduction of `dpv:ServiceManagement`. This concept should therefore be used only to describe the provision of a service, and should not be used to represent its management, monitoring, or other non-provision related purposes (see the taxonomy for other Service Management related purposes)"@en ;
