  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Sector"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Sector describes the area of application or domain that indicates or restricts scope for interpretation and application of purpose e.g. Agriculture, Banking"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "There are various sector codes used commonly to indicate the domain of an organisation or business. Examples include NACE (EU), ISIC (UN), SIC and NAICS (USA)."@en ;
