  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://w3id.org/dpv#processing-context-classes> .

<https://w3id.org/dpv#PhysicalAuthorisation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#PhysicalMeasure> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Physical Authorisation"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Physical implementation of authorisation e.g. by stamping a visitor pass"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#PhysicalMeasure> ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "NIST SP 800-16"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2024-04-14"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
