  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Termination Clause"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A provision outlining the conditions under which the contract can be terminated before its completion, including any penalties or obligations"@en ;
