<https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractActive> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>, <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class>, <https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractActivationStatus> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Contract Active"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Status representing contract that has been fully executed and whose terms are considered active i.e. they are applicable and are required to be performed"@en ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#broader> <https://w3id.org/dpv#ContractActivationStatus> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote> "A contract being active only refers to its terms now being required to be fulfilled, while dpv:ContractBeingPerformed states that they are being performed"@en ;
  <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "2025-01-09"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> ;
  <http://www.w3.org/2003/06/sw-vocab-status/ns#term_status> "accepted"@en ;
